# NPU (Neural Processing Unit) - Top Module Documentation

## Overview

The NPU Top Module is a complete, parameterizable neural network accelerator that can execute multi-layer neural networks. It integrates the systolic array for matrix multiplication and the VPU for post-processing operations.

