## Module Interface

### Parameters

| Parameter      | Default | Description                                    |
|----------------|---------|------------------------------------------------|
| NUM_LAYERS     | 3       | Number of layers in the neural network         |
| DATA_WIDTH     | 8       | Width of input data and weights                |
| ACC_WIDTH      | 32      | Width of accumulators and intermediate values  |
| FRAC_BITS      | 8       | Fractional bits for fixed-point arithmetic     |
| MATRIX_SIZE    | 9       | Size of matrices (9 for 3×3)                   |

### Ports

#### Inputs
- `clk` - Clock signal
- `rst` - Asynchronous reset (active high)
- `start` - Start inference (pulse)
- `input_data[0:MATRIX_SIZE-1]` - Input data array
- `weights[0:MATRIX_SIZE-1]` - Weight matrix for current layer
- `bias_layer[0:NUM_LAYERS-1]` - Bias values for each layer
- `vpu_ops_layer[0:NUM_LAYERS-1]` - VPU operation for each layer
- `scale_layer[0:NUM_LAYERS-1]` - Scale factors for each layer

#### Outputs
- `output_data[0:MATRIX_SIZE-1]` - Final output after all layers
- `done` - Inference complete flag
- `current_layer[7:0]` - Currently processing layer index
- `state[3:0]` - Current FSM state (for debugging)

