## Configuration Example

### 3-Layer Classification Network

```verilog
// Layer 1: Input → Hidden (16 neurons)
// Operation: MatMul → Bias → ReLU
bias_layer[0] = 10;
vpu_ops_layer[0] = 3'd1;  // RELU
scale_layer[0] = 256;     // 1.0

// Layer 2: Hidden → Hidden (16 neurons)
// Operation: MatMul → Bias → ReLU
bias_layer[1] = 5;
vpu_ops_layer[1] = 3'd1;  // RELU
scale_layer[1] = 256;     // 1.0

// Layer 3: Hidden → Output (classification)
// Operation: MatMul → Bias → Sigmoid
bias_layer[2] = 0;
vpu_ops_layer[2] = 3'd6;  // SIGMOID
scale_layer[2] = 256;     // 1.0
```

