## Scaling to Larger Networks

### More Layers
Simply change the `NUM_LAYERS` parameter:
```verilog
npu_top #(
    .NUM_LAYERS(5),  // 5-layer network
    ...
) my_npu (...);
```

### Larger Matrices
For NxN matrices where N ≠ 3:
1. Modify `MATRIX_SIZE` parameter
2. Update systolic array to NxN
3. Update VPU to handle N² elements

### Multiple NPUs
For parallel processing:
```verilog
// Process multiple inputs simultaneously
npu_top npu0 (.input_data(input0), ...);
npu_top npu1 (.input_data(input1), ...);
npu_top npu2 (.input_data(input2), ...);
```

