## Example Networks

### 1. Binary Classifier
```
Layers: 3
Layer 0: Input(3×3) → Hidden(3×3) + ReLU
Layer 1: Hidden(3×3) → Hidden(3×3) + ReLU  
Layer 2: Hidden(3×3) → Output(3×3) + Sigmoid
Output: Classification scores
```

### 2. Feature Extractor
```
Layers: 2
Layer 0: Input(3×3) → Features(3×3) + ReLU
Layer 1: Features(3×3) → Output(3×3) + MaxPool
Output: Pooled features
```

### 3. Autoencoder
```
Layers: 3
Layer 0: Input(3×3) → Encoded(3×3) + ReLU (encoder)
Layer 1: Encoded(3×3) → Decoded(3×3) + ReLU
Layer 2: Decoded(3×3) → Output(3×3) + Sigmoid (reconstruction)
```

