## Performance Characteristics

### Throughput
- **Latency**: ~16 cycles/layer
- **3-Layer Network**: ~48 cycles total
- **At 100 MHz**: 480 ns per inference
- **Throughput**: ~2 million inferences/second

### Resource Utilization (Typical FPGA)
- **9 Processing Elements** (MAC units)
- **1 VPU** (post-processing)
- **Memory**: Layer buffers + weight storage
- **Control Logic**: FSM + counters

### Power Efficiency
- **Active Power**: During computation (systolic + VPU)
- **Idle Power**: Minimal (FSM only)
- **Per-layer**: Power cycles with activity

