## Integration with External Memory

### Option 1: Direct Weight Input
```verilog
// External weight memory controller
weight_controller weight_ctrl (
    .layer_index(current_layer),
    .weights_out(weights)
);
```

### Option 2: AXI Interface
```verilog
// AXI master to fetch weights
axi_master weight_fetch (
    .layer_index(current_layer),
    .m_axi_*(...),
    .weights_out(weights)
);
```

### Option 3: On-chip BRAM
```verilog
// Block RAM for weight storage
weight_memory #(
    .NUM_LAYERS(3),
    .WEIGHTS_PER_LAYER(9)
) weight_mem (
    .addr(current_layer),
    .data_out(weights)
);
```

